01:23:09,600 --> 01:23:15,600
JFK is a 1991 American epic political thriller film
co-written and directed by Oliver Stone.

12
01:30:43,200 --> 01:30:49,200
The film examines the investigation into the assassination of John F.

13
01:38:16,800 --> 01:38:22,800
Kennedy by New Orleans district attorney Jim Garrison, who came to believe there was a
government conspiracy to assassinate Kennedy and that Lee Harvey Oswald was a scapegoat.

14
01:45:50,400 --> 01:45:56,400
The film's screenplay was adapted by Stone and Zachary Sklar from the books On the Trail of the
Assassins by Garrison and Crossfire: The Plot That Killed Kennedy by Jim Marrs.

15
01:53:24,000 --> 01:53:30,000
Stone described this account as a "counter-myth" to the
Warren Commission's "fictional myth".

16
02:00:57,600 --> 02:01:03,600
JFK's embrace of conspiracy theories made it controversial.

17
02:08:31,200 --> 02:08:37,200
Many major American newspapers ran editorials accusing Stone of spreading untruths, including the claim
that Kennedy was killed as part of a coup d'état to install Vice President Lyndon B.

18
02:16:04,800 --> 02:16:10,800
Johnson in his place.

19
02:23:38,399 --> 02:23:44,399
Despite the controversy, JFK received critical praise for its
performances, directing, score, editing, and cinematography.

20
02:31:12,000 --> 02:31:18,000
It also gradually picked up momentum at the box office after a slow start, grossing over $205 million worldwide,
making it the sixth highest-grossing film of 1991 worldwide and Stone's highest-grossing film to date.

21
02:38:45,600 --> 02:38:51,600
It was nominated for eight Academy Awards, including Best Picture, and
won two for Best Cinematography and Best Film Editing.

22
02:46:19,200 --> 02:46:25,200
It was the first of three films Stone made about American
presidents, followed by Nixon (1995) and W.

23
02:53:52,800 --> 02:53:58,800
The film explores themes of vietnam war, central intelligence
agency (cia), assassination, usa president, government.

24
03:01:26,400 --> 03:01:32,400
The tone is emotional and intense.
